  "html": "<b><br></b>\n\n<b><br></b>\n<b><br></b><br>\n<b>Katechezės paskaitėlė Vilniaus šv. Paraskevės parapijoje šv. Jono Pakopininko dienos proga.</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<b>Deja, įkėlus video, kažkodėl skaidrės ėmė atsilikti nuo garso.</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<b>Dėl visko pikto, pridedu kelias pastabas:</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<b>1. Ortodoksų Bažnyčios mokymas apie išganymą - sinergijos (sąveikos, bendradarbiavimo) teorija. Išganymas - Dievo ir žmogaus valių bendradarbiavimas. Žmogus savo valia trokšta iš ganymo, deda pastangas, Dievas išgano savąja malone.&nbsp;</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<b>2. „Paslydo“ liežuvis - vietoje „Jono laiškas“, regis, sykį pasakiau „laiškas Jonui“.</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<b>3. Dėl knygos „sukimo ratu“, turėjau omenyje, turėtų būti tarp kasdien skaitomų knygų, kurias skaito vis iš naujo... Nelabai aiškiai išsireiškiau.</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-E9sg5iXwqgc/Uzg4bfPfHMI/AAAAAAAAAnM/LG5_pS0UcNQ/s1600/The_Ladder_of_Divine_Ascent_Monastery_of_St_Catherine_Sinai_12th_century.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-E9sg5iXwqgc/Uzg4bfPfHMI/AAAAAAAAAnM/LG5_pS0UcNQ/s1600/The_Ladder_of_Divine_Ascent_Monastery_of_St_Catherine_Sinai_12th_century.jpg\" width=\"278\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<b><br></b>\n<b><br></b>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-WSb-tzGPSVM/Uzg323_kWvI/AAAAAAAAAmQ/lUXp1DgBH1o/s1600/1.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"216\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-WSb-tzGPSVM/Uzg323_kWvI/AAAAAAAAAmQ/lUXp1DgBH1o/s1600/1.JPG\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-f33yKaMQ_cM/Uzg33Hd_0tI/AAAAAAAAAmU/hI2S7FlPw0g/s1600/2.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"298\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-f33yKaMQ_cM/Uzg33Hd_0tI/AAAAAAAAAmU/hI2S7FlPw0g/s1600/2.JPG\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-w6cD_iPhtb0/Uzg33LqlV3I/AAAAAAAAAmc/FrFGjfHs0Yw/s1600/3.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-w6cD_iPhtb0/Uzg33LqlV3I/AAAAAAAAAmc/FrFGjfHs0Yw/s1600/3.JPG\" width=\"299\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-YvUD9RVQWDk/Uzg337_NGSI/AAAAAAAAAmw/kDP4fLf-q0Q/s1600/4.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-YvUD9RVQWDk/Uzg337_NGSI/AAAAAAAAAmw/kDP4fLf-q0Q/s1600/4.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Wg7m1cj7ScI/Uzg34NEyYcI/AAAAAAAAAmo/gu6MF6sb02U/s1600/5.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"299\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Wg7m1cj7ScI/Uzg34NEyYcI/AAAAAAAAAmo/gu6MF6sb02U/s1600/5.JPG\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-UG4JcrzSA9Y/Uzg34Q05PII/AAAAAAAAAms/piSpwD_fCQw/s1600/6.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"289\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-UG4JcrzSA9Y/Uzg34Q05PII/AAAAAAAAAms/piSpwD_fCQw/s1600/6.JPG\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fDI6LLBMuz8/Uzg34g_wiuI/AAAAAAAAAnA/_dNXx_7rYjM/s1600/7.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"220\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020071404im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fDI6LLBMuz8/Uzg34g_wiuI/AAAAAAAAAnA/_dNXx_7rYjM/s1600/7.JPG